From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 11:47:15 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] droidvenc: do not leave the codec callbacks uninitialised

droidvenc filled in two of DroidMediaCodecCallbacks' members on the
stack and left size_changed as whatever was there. droidmedia calls
size_changed when the codec reports a new output format, which a Codec2
encoder does with its first output: on sargo (c2.qti.avc.encoder) that
call jumped to stack garbage and the process died with SIGBUS right
after "notifySizeChanged" in the log.

Zero both callback structures, so a callback that is not set is NULL,
which droidmedia checks for.

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Submitted [https://github.com/sailfishos/gst-droid/pull/91]
---
 gst/droidcodec/gstdroidvenc.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/gst/droidcodec/gstdroidvenc.c b/gst/droidcodec/gstdroidvenc.c
index 9f2fdd7..8cb98c1 100644
--- a/gst/droidcodec/gstdroidvenc.c
+++ b/gst/droidcodec/gstdroidvenc.c
@@ -171,14 +171,14 @@ gst_droidvenc_create_codec (GstDroidVEnc * enc)
   }
 
   {
-    DroidMediaCodecCallbacks cb;
+    DroidMediaCodecCallbacks cb = { 0 };
     cb.signal_eos = gst_droidvenc_signal_eos;
     cb.error = gst_droidvenc_error;
     droid_media_codec_set_callbacks (enc->codec, &cb, enc);
   }
 
   {
-    DroidMediaCodecDataCallbacks cb;
+    DroidMediaCodecDataCallbacks cb = { 0 };
     cb.data_available = gst_droidvenc_data_available;
     droid_media_codec_set_data_callbacks (enc->codec, &cb, enc);
   }
